+| YouTrack/YouTrackMCPServer | YouTrackMCPServer/Jenkinsfile | — | youtrack-mcp-server | YoutrackMcpDeploy |
+| Webathome | Webathome/Jenkinsfile | copies the apk from MyDownloads/MyDownloadsClient | webathome_org | WebathomeOrgDeploy |
